# This repository is PRIVATE on purpose and must stay that way: it carries the launcher's
# signing key, Nintendo's and Mojang's screenshots, the TV's settings snapshot and the
# household's details, so the project can be picked up on another computer. dumbtv upstream
# ignores report/ and dumbtv.conf; they are tracked here.
# The signing key is not: copy it to a new computer by hand (see HANDOFF.md).
launcher/*.keystore
*.log
.DS_Store
*.dumbtv
launcher/build/
video/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
